The schema keeps MCP's own descriptions, word for word, where schema.json
gives one, and the text of each @deprecated tag in schema.ts, and so do the
files generated from it. Those texts are MCP's work under the terms above,
not this project's. Where MCP gives no description, the words are this
project's (scripts/mcp_to_linkml.py lists them). The structure, names and
constraints follow schema.json and schema.ts, and meta/schema.json is MCP's
schema regenerated from that rendering.

